[{"id":2571659697,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSGmx","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm a little bit skeptical. Vector also does power of 2 resizes. Simply changing LocalVector to Vector shouldn't change the number of allocations.\r\n\r\n`Vector::resize()` calls `CowData::resize()` which requests an allocation size here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b0655dc86f096b3496a9ab5b18965676d4fb35ba/core/templates/cowdata.h#L362\r\n\r\nWhich calls `_get_alloc_size()` which returns the next power of two\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b0655dc86f096b3496a9ab5b18965676d4fb35ba/core/templates/cowdata.h#L137-L139","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950#pullrequestreview-2571659697","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950#pullrequestreview-2571659697"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-24T05:16:45Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2831541663,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6oxeWf","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This makes sense to me. I'm pretty sure the `Vector<Glyphs>` has no big risk of needing to be copied around anywhere, so it should be `LocalVector`.\r\n\r\n`LocalVector` has recently also switched behavior to use 1.5x growth, and it should reserve exactly to the target size when a large resize is used, which might save RAM. Perhaps it's worth rebasing and taking new measurements?","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950#pullrequestreview-2831541663","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950#pullrequestreview-2831541663"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-11T23:45:13Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2832437692,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6o05G8","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think `text_server_adv.cpp:6168` would be a regression with this PR because it is forced to copy the glyphs array. This needs to be addressed. I'm not sure why the code is set up the way it does, but an `std::move` could do the trick maybe?\r\n\r\nI'm also still interested, does this PR measurably affect peak RAM use / persistent allocations size in the editor?","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950#pullrequestreview-2832437692","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950#pullrequestreview-2832437692"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-12T09:03:05Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2832690346,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6o12yq","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc